cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: Seizure Neural Fragility
abstract: Computes neural fragility (Li et al. 2021) of each iEEG channel around a seizure onset with
  the EZFragility R package, in 250 ms windows from 60 s before to 30 s after the onset, and writes
  the mean fragility before and after onset and the channel ranking, for seizure onset zone
  localisation in the Seizure Onset Localisation workflow.
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/processor-seizure-fragility
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
keywords:
- ieeg
- seeg
- electrophysiology
- epilepsy
- seizure-onset
- neural-fragility
- network-model
